      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.1cor.bohairic_ed:8",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲧⲉⲩⲉⲓ ⲉⲡ**ϣⲱⲧ** ⲛⲕⲉⲥⲟⲡ ⲛⲥⲉⲣⲣⲙⲙⲁⲟ ·",
      "english": "Fol. 19a col. 1 and they amass | riches.",
